#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:131
msgid "Create preview link"
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:132
msgid "Issues a shareable link that lets a logged-out reviewer view a draft before it is published. Returns the preview URL and the timestamp it expires. The URL contains a secret token, so treat the result as sensitive."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:144
msgid "The shareable preview URL, carrying the secret token."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:148
msgid "Unix timestamp when the link expires."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:175
msgid "List preview links"
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:176
msgid "Lists the active preview links — their usage, expiry, and a short token hint — so an existing link can be reused instead of minting a duplicate. Pass a post ID to list one post's links, or omit it to list every live link on the site (which needs broader permissions). The shareable URL is not returned (only a hint), because the token itself is never stored."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:183
msgid "ID of the post whose preview links to list. Omit to list every live link on the site."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:187
msgid "Only the links this user created — the site-wide listing's creator filter, so it cannot be combined with post_id."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:198
msgid "ID of the post the link previews."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:202
msgid "Token hash identifying the link."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:206
msgid "Last few characters of the token, to recognise the link."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:216
msgid "IP ranges the link is restricted to; empty means no per-link restriction."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:221
msgid "Emails of the named reviewers the link is bound to; empty means anyone with the link can view."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:244
msgid "Revoke preview link"
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:245
msgid "Revokes preview links at one of four scopes, mirroring the admin page's tools: one of a post's links (a token hint or link id from list-preview-links), every live link on a post, every link a given user created (the offboarding sweep), or every live link on the site (the break-glass switch — needs administrator rights). A revoked link stops working immediately; a visitor opening it is told it was revoked."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:252
msgid "ID of the post whose preview link to revoke. Omit for the site-wide scopes."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:256
msgid "The link to revoke: a token hint or a full link id, as returned by list-preview-links. Needs post_id; omit when revoking a wider scope."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:260
msgid "Revoke every link this user created, across the whole site — e.g. when someone leaves."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:265
msgid "With post_id, revoke every live link on the post; on its own, revoke every live link on the site."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:274
msgid "How many links were revoked in this run."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:278
msgid "True when a site-wide sweep was too large for one run; the rest are being revoked in the background."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:301
msgid "Prune preview links"
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:302
msgid "Deletes expired and revoked preview links past their retention period, site-wide. The scheduled sweep does this daily; run it when waiting is not acceptable. Until a dead link is pruned, a visitor opening it is told why it stopped working; after, they see a plain 404."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:310
msgid "Override the retention period for dead links, in seconds. 0 deletes every expired or revoked link immediately. Omit to use the configured grace period."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:319
msgid "How many dead links were deleted."
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:342
msgid "Enable or disable preview links"
msgstr ""

#: inc/class-previewabilities.php:343
msgid "Turns preview links on or off site-wide. Disabling is a reversible pause, not a revocation: every link keeps its own state and simply stops working until links are re-enabled, which makes it the first response to a suspected leak. Returns the resulting state, including who disabled links and when."
msgstr ""

